### Open-Meteo: current temperature and wind speed for Fullerton, CA.
### Returns: JSON with a `current` object containing temperature_2m and wind_speed_10m.
GET https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=33.8704&longitude=-117.9242&current=temperature_2m,wind_speed_10m
Accept: application/json

###

### Canvas LMS: upcoming assignments/events for the authenticated user.
### Returns: JSON array of upcoming event objects (assignments, quizzes, etc.)
### with fields like id, title, html_url, and assignment.due_at.
GET https://{{$dotenv CANVAS_DOMAIN}}/api/v1/users/self/upcoming_events
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv CANVAS_TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json

###

### GitHub: recent public activity for a user.
### Returns: JSON array of event objects (PushEvent, PullRequestEvent, etc.)
### with fields like id, type, repo.name, payload, and created_at.
GET https://api.github.com/users/{{$dotenv GITHUB_USERNAME}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv GITHUB_TOKEN}}
Accept: application/vnd.github+json

###
